zeus (0.1.0) stable; urgency=medium

  * fix(deploy): remove stray text corrupting zeus.service
  * add release build and packager
  * feat(playback): show main and sub streams side by side
  * feat(db): migration ledger, pre-migration backup, downgrade refusal
  * fix(reliability): clear stale degraded status; wait for go2rtc on boot
  * feat(native): Safire on-screen-display control via reverse-engineered protocol
  * feat(ptz): preset save/overwrite/delete; ONVIF device-info lookup
  * feat(admin): reorganize camera settings into tabs; expose new controls
  * feat(janitor): honor motion_prune_streams for tiered retention
  * feat(detect): wire tier0_bypass and presence-extend into the pipeline
  * feat(config): schema for tier0 bypass, presence-extend, motion-prune, live overlay
  * feat(discovery): single-device ONVIF probe for the add-camera form
  * feat(live): digital zoom, drag-to-position overlay, mobile fixes
  * feat(live): replace WHEP signalling with a native HLS relay
  * feat: add initial README with project overview, features, and setup instructions
  * feat: continue NVR operations and snapshot controls
  * feat: enhance camera configuration and storage management
  * feat(discovery): ONVIF/template camera discovery with verified auto-add
  * feat: update .gitignore to include additional design files
  * feat(web): redesign NVR operator interface
  * feat: complete Phase 5 plan — intelligence (Tasks 1-10)
  * feat: complete Phase 4 plan — operations (Tasks 1-14)
  * test(api): Phase 3 end-to-end integration test, browser acceptance and README   notes
  * feat: complete Phase 1+2 plan (Tasks 27-28) with integration, load-test acceptance and container   image
  * feat: Phase 1 core recorder and Phase 2 detector through Task 26

